0 Great Pyramid of Giza - 7 stepped tiers, 14x14 stud base, tan
0 Name: great_pyramid.ldr
0 Author: LEGO Designer
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 BFC CERTIFY CCW
0 // Each tier = one plate course (8 LDU) + one brick course (24 LDU) = 32 LDU
0 // The plate course of every tier rests on the tier below and carries all of
0 // that tier's bricks, so every element is stud-connected (single cluster).
0 // Tier n: plate at y = -32*(n-1), bricks at y = -32*(n-1)-8
0 // Total height = 7 * 32 = 224 LDU
0 // Entrance: 2 studs wide x 2 studs deep x 1 brick tall on the +Z face,
0 // bridged by a 2x4 plate lintel at y = -32.
